LR: Yes. You know, you-- you-- if you-- you-- I mean, whatever I tell you, you never could-- you-- you-- never-- only a person have to be there to experience exactly how really, bad it was. Whatever I told you, it's never as bad.

How bad it sounds to you, it's never as bad as-- as to being there, how really, it was. You, just-- you cannot-- you cannot express yourself. It's-- it's have to be there, how bad it was. It's--

And all these are newcomers. Only strive come to this country, their children should have an education and be successful. That's what our-- we-- all the newcomers, mostly, with the children, they tried to-- to-- for them to go to school.

INT: Are you still capable of laughing at a good joke?

